-03-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=Who%20had%20done%20this%3F,who%20had%20done%20this.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e13","summary":"A winged figure, perhaps Avacyn, blasts the roof off and strikes Liont with a lance of energy.","participants":["liont","avacyn"],"location":"liont-s-house","importance":"major","page":"stories/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","order":271,"story_date":"2016-03-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"She pointed her spear at him, and the tip grew bright, brighter, brighter than the sun overhead, and a lancing energy struck him in the chest, burning away clothes and skin.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=She%20pointed%20her%20spear,away%20clothes%20and%20skin.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2016-03-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=She%20pointed%20her%20spear,away%20clothes%20and%20skin.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e14","summary":"Refusing his plea for mercy, the angel kills Liont.","participants":["liont","avacyn"],"location":"liont-s-house","importance":"major","page":"stories/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","order":271,"story_date":"2016-03-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":94,"quote":"and then he died.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitil